Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UndergroundParkingLaneWaterAccumulation" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :EvidenceBasedAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasEvidence :evidence1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Accumulated water on the road surface" .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition .

:evidence1 a :RollingBallIndicator ;
    :description "Water accumulation causing potential hydroplaning" ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :risk1 .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Vehicle driving through water accumulation" .

:risk1 a :RoadConditionRisk ;
    :description "Hydroplaning risk due to water accumulation on the road" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Reduced visibility due to water spray from preceding vehicle" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.7"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Hydroplaning risk due to water accumulation on the road
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Reduced visibility due to water spray from preceding vehicle
Severity Score: 0.7